Imagine we have total 1-9 doors. 
we need to open exactly k doors so that the labels on them add up to n 

At each step we decide two things: 

1. Open this door (include the number)
2. Skip this door (move to the next door)

one we opened k doors, check if the sum is equals to n
if yes -> add it to ans. 
if no -> discard and backtrack 

now if sum already exceeds n, stop further exploring. 
if we've already picked k numbers but the sum isn't n stop. 


